From 7a26a4e67f9dee399c963b94d1cd9d6890218f67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 01:50:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 31/54] Hide account and missing-feature UI in embedded builds

The user menu ends after "Join our Slack community" (no Sign up, Upgrade, Invite a friend, Log
out, What's new). "Keyboard shortcuts" and Cmd+/ open the settings page instead of the resource
center side pane, which embedded builds don't show. The Keyboard shortcuts page and the command
palette leave out bindings of features embedded builds don't have: Warp's agent and Warp AI,
cloud agents, Warp Drive objects, sharing, teams, accounts, updates, slash commands and left
panel views other than Agents.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
